@startuml Sequence_Security_Audit
autonumber
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Sequence Diagram: Phân quyền Contextual ABAC & Audit Log Bất biến (ASR-03 & ASR-05)

actor "Lễ tân Đà Nẵng\n(Attacker / Misuser)" as Staff
participant "API Gateway\n(TLS Termination)" as GW
participant "Auth Middleware\n(Token Verifier)" as Auth
participant "ABAC Policy Engine\n(Context Checker)" as ABAC
participant "EHR Service\n(Medical Records)" as EHR
participant "Audit Service\n(HMAC Chaining)" as Audit
participant "Audit Store\n(Postgres Append-Only)" as AuditDB

Staff -> GW: GET /api/ehr/records/REC-HUE-5544\n[Authorization: Bearer <JWT_Token_Staff_Danang>]

GW -> Auth: Validate Token & Claims
activate Auth
Auth --> Auth: Trích xuất Payload:\n{sub: "staff_dn_01", role: "RECEPTIONIST", facility_id: "FAC_DANANG"}
Auth -> EHR: Query Metadata for "REC-HUE-5544"
deactivate Auth

activate EHR
EHR --> EHR: Truy xuất thuộc tính tài nguyên:\n{record_id: "REC-HUE-5544", facility_id: "FAC_HUE", is_sensitive: true}
EHR -> ABAC: evaluatePolicy(subject, resource, action="READ")
deactivate EHR

activate ABAC
Note over ABAC: Kiểm tra Quy tắc ABAC:\n1. role == "RECEPTIONIST"? -> TRUE\n2. subject.facility_id == resource.facility_id?\n"FAC_DANANG" == "FAC_HUE"? -> FALSE (XUNG ĐỘT CƠ SỞ)
ABAC --> Auth: ACCESS_DENIED ("Truy cập trái tuyến ngoài phạm vi cơ sở phân công")
deactivate ABAC

group #MistyRose Bước 2: Ghi nhận Vi phạm An ninh vào Chuỗi Kiểm toán Bất biến
    Auth -> Audit: logSecurityViolation({\n  actor: "staff_dn_01",\n  role: "RECEPTIONIST",\n  target: "REC-HUE-5544",\n  action: "UNAUTHORIZED_READ_ATTEMPT",\n  status: 403\n})
    activate Audit
    Note over Audit: Tính toán mã băm HMAC liên hoàn:\nprev_hash = SELECT current_hash FROM audit_logs ORDER BY id DESC LIMIT 1\nhash = HMAC_SHA256(SECRET_KEY, prev_hash + timestamp + actor + action + target)
    Audit -> AuditDB: INSERT INTO audit_logs (prev_hash, current_hash, data) [APPEND-ONLY]
    AuditDB --> Audit: Record Persisted (ID = 88219)
    deactivate Audit
end

Auth --> GW: HTTP 403 Forbidden ("Truy cập bị từ chối: Hồ sơ thuộc quyền cơ sở khác")
GW --> Staff: HTTP 403 Forbidden\n{error: "PERMISSION_DENIED", incident_id: "SEC-88219"}

@enduml
